        "quote": "If the City does work in the right-of-way and finds it necessary to maintain, support, or move a registrant’s equipment to protect it, the Director shall notify the local representative as early as is reasonably possible. The costs associated therewith will be billed to that registrant and must be paid within 30 days from the date of billing.",
