          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.30.250:block:1",
          "start": 345
        },
        "quote": "Each registrant shall be responsible for the cost of repairing any equipment in the right-of-way which it or its equipment damages. Each registrant shall be responsible for the cost of repairing any damage to the equipment of another registrant caused during the City’s response to an emergency occasioned by that registrant’s equipment. (Ord. 17587 § 5-21, 10-24-00. Code 1995 § 130-696.)",
